# {{senseid|en|Q5871}}{{lb|en|star}} The [[dim]], highly [[dense]] [[core]] [[remnant]] that is the final stage in the [[evolution]] of a [[star]] of low or medium [[mass]], after [[nuclear reaction]]s have ceased.

